        "answer": {
          "short": "$y=-\\dfrac{1}{3x^3}+\\dfrac{2}{x}+C$",
          "worked": "$\\begin{aligned}y&=\\frac{x^{-3}}{-3}-\\frac{2x^{-1}}{-1}+C\\\\y&=-\\frac{1}{3x^3}+\\frac{2}{x}+C\\end{aligned}$",
