        "answer": {
          "short": "$y=\\dfrac{x^4}{20}-\\dfrac{x^3}{3}+C$",
          "worked": "$\\begin{aligned}y&=\\frac{1}{5}\\cdot\\frac{x^4}{4}-\\frac{x^3}{3}+C\\\\y&=\\frac{x^4}{20}-\\frac{x^3}{3}+C\\end{aligned}$",
