          "short": "$y=\\dfrac{x^4}{4}-\\dfrac{x^2}{3}+x+C$",
          "worked": "$\\begin{aligned}y&=\\frac{x^4}{4}-\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot\\frac{x^2}{2}+x+C\\\\y&=\\frac{x^4}{4}-\\frac{x^2}{3}+x+C\\end{aligned}$",
